<title>USA: Mercantile Bankshares raises shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Mercantile Bankshares raises shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mercantile Bankshares Corp said Tuesday its directors increased the company's share buyback authorization by one million shares.</p>
<p>This raises the total remaining authorization to about 2.5 million shares, including those under previously announced buyback programs, the company said.</p>
<p>About 47 million shares are outstanding.</p>
<p>Mercantile shares were unchanged Tuesday at 33-1/2.</p>
</text>
